Assertions
-----------


1. expect(page).toHaveUrl()  page has URl
2. expect(page).not.toHaveUrl()  /negative validation on uRl
3. toHaveTitle  | expect(page).toHavetitle() --> check page has title or not
4. Element Visibility | expect(locator).toBeVisible() | Element is visible
5. expect(locator).toBeEnabled()  | control/element is enabled
6. expect(locator).toBeDisabled()  | control/element is Disabled
7. expect(locator).toBeChecked() | Radio/Checkbox is checked.
8. expect(locator).toHaveCount() | list of elements has given length
9. expect(locator).toHaveAttribute()
10. expect(locator).toHaveText();
11. expect(locator).toContains();
12. expect(locator).toHaveValue();
























